WEBVTT

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.890
<i>For whom shall I sing?</i>

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:07.320
<i>I dislike music.</i>

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:12.750
<i>My heart always manages to find
some sadness in the flowing notes.{The flowing notes cause my spirits to fall.}{argh}</i>

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.990
<i>For whose sake does music exist?{BINBOU PHILOSOPHY HOUR}</i>

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.190
It’s that voice again!{That voice again, the one we always hear!}{I can hear that voice again!}

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.760
Asu!

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:56.160
Is it really some woman’s ghost?

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.360
D-Don’t worry, Onee-chan.

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.280
I’m here for you.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:15.090
Thank you, Asu.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:20.030
You’re really brave, Asu!

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.990
No, I’m not really…

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:35.060
Mom went to heaven the year Asu was born.

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:38.810
Dad disappeared after accumulating gambling debts.

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:42.990
Thus, we were abandoned.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:47.820
This is a 40-year-old, one-room,
dilapidated apartment with no bath.

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:49.890
This is our home.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.570
But, when spring comes…

