00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:28.340
But…

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:37.980
But, I <i>do</i> want to keep on singing.

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:42.070
That’s why I got a part time job, so I could afford to reclaim my guitar.

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:45.160
His guitar…{lul}

00:19:54.780 --> 00:19:56.320
Because I made a promise.

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:59.140
A promise that I would sing for you again.

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:28.220
Flowing easily along,

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:28.050
<i>I sing.</i>

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:32.130
<i>That’s what I can do. The only thing I can do.</i>

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:31.220
the wind whispers by.

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:35.080
In that way.

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:35.050
<i>Music is mysterious.</i>

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:37.810
<i>With the ebb and flow of each note,</i>

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:41.660
In the radiant fields of green,

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:41.800
<i>I can feel my spirits rising.{yeah so what I destroyed the parallels between the opening and the closing WHAT YOU GONNA DO ABOUT IT}</i>

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:44.760
let’s invite the spring.

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:47.080
<i>That’s why I will keep on singing.</i>

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:47.980
In that way.

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:54.840
Glittering, sparkling,

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:57.940
basking in the rays of sunlight.

00:20:57.210 --> 00:21:01.350
<i>That’s why I want to stay here forever.</i>

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:01.760
In that way.

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:08.120
A rustling heart is

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:03.710
<i>I’ll try my best with Onee-chan.</i>

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:11.150
<i>So we will always be able to hear the music.</i>

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:11.170
a memory of summer.

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:14.700
In that way.

